<h1 class="h1" style="margin:0 0 18px;font-size:28px;line-height:36px;color:#0b2a6f;font-weight:700">{{ user.name.first }} would like to join the Turn2Opinion Teen panel</h1></td></tr>
<tr><td class="px" style="padding:0 44px 6px;font-family:'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:26px;color:#2b3550"><p style="margin:0 0 14px">Dear {{ user.parent.name.first }},</p><p style="margin:0 0 14px">{{ user.name.first }} has registered for the Turn2Opinion Teen panel and named you as their <b>{{ relation }}</b>. Teens aged 13 to 17 can join only with the permission of a parent or legal guardian, so nothing happens without your decision.</p><table role="presentation" width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="margin:16px 0;border-radius:14px;background:#f6f1e4;border:1px solid #e2d8c3"><tr><td style="padding:18px 20px;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#2b3550"><b style="color:#0b2a6f">What the Teen panel is</b><br>Turn2Opinion is a market research panel. Teen members are invited to short, age-appropriate online surveys about things like technology, entertainment, shopping and everyday life, and can earn rewards for completed surveys. Taking part is free and voluntary: your teen can skip any question or stop at any time, and nothing has to be bought.</td></tr></table><p style="margin:0 0 6px;font-weight:700;color:#0b2a6f">How it works if you say yes</p><table role="presentation" width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="margin:6px 0 4px"><tr><td width="38" valign="top" style="padding:6px 0"><div style="width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:#f1e6c8;color:#0b2a6f;font-weight:900;font-size:14px;line-height:28px;text-align:center">1</div></td><td style="padding:8px 0;color:#2b3550;font-size:15px;line-height:23px">You review your teen&rsquo;s request and confirm you are their parent or legal guardian.</td></tr><tr><td width="38" valign="top" style="padding:6px 0"><div style="width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:#f1e6c8;color:#0b2a6f;font-weight:900;font-size:14px;line-height:28px;text-align:center">2</div></td><td style="padding:8px 0;color:#2b3550;font-size:15px;line-height:23px">You fill in a short onboarding form about you (about 3 minutes).</td></tr><tr><td width="38" valign="top" style="padding:6px 0"><div style="width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:#f1e6c8;color:#0b2a6f;font-weight:900;font-size:14px;line-height:28px;text-align:center">3</div></td><td style="padding:8px 0;color:#2b3550;font-size:15px;line-height:23px">You read the Teen participation agreement and tick the permissions you give.</td></tr><tr><td width="38" valign="top" style="padding:6px 0"><div style="width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:#f1e6c8;color:#0b2a6f;font-weight:900;font-size:14px;line-height:28px;text-align:center">4</div></td><td style="padding:8px 0;color:#2b3550;font-size:15px;line-height:23px">We email your teen a secure link to create their own password. You get a confirmation.</td></tr></table><p style="margin:18px 0 8px;font-weight:800;color:#0b2a6f;font-size:18px;text-align:center">Do you want to enrol {{ user.name.first }} in the Teen panel?</p><table role="presentation" width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"><tr><td class="stack" width="50%" style="padding:8px"><table role="presentation" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="margin:0 auto"><tr><td align="center" bgcolor="#0f7b4a" style="border-radius:14px;"><a href="{{ links.yes }}" target="_blank" style="display:inline-block;padding:18px 34px;font-family:'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:14px;letter-spacing:.2px">YES &mdash; I want to enrol my Teen</a></td></tr></table></td><td class="stack" width="50%" style="padding:8px"><table role="presentation" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="margin:0 auto"><tr><td align="center" bgcolor="#ffffff" style="border-radius:14px;border:2px solid #9b1c1c;"><a href="{{ links.no }}" target="_blank" style="display:inline-block;padding:18px 34px;font-family:'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#9b1c1c;text-decoration:none;border-radius:14px;letter-spacing:.2px">NO &mdash; I do not want to enrol my Teen</a></td></tr></table></td></tr></table><p style="margin:10px 0 0;font-size:13px;color:#5d6478;text-align:center">Both buttons open a secure page where you can confirm your choice. This link expires in 7 days.</p><table role="presentation" width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="margin:16px 0;border-radius:14px;background:#eef3ff;border:1px solid #cfdcff"><tr><td style="padding:18px 20px;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#2b3550"><b style="color:#0b2a6f">What we will ask you</b><br>Your name, date of birth, country and region, your relationship to the teen, how you prefer to be contacted, and three optional questions about your teen&rsquo;s health that help us keep unsuitable studies away from them. Then three required permissions and three optional ones.</td></tr></table><p style="margin:0;font-size:14px;color:#5d6478">Did not expect this email? Choose <b>No</b> and tell us you do not recognise the request. The registration will be closed and no account will be created.</p></td></tr>

